#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000007
msgid "Peace Walker is a weapon of peace, after all. "
msgstr "和平行者本就是和平的武器。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000008
msgid "First, we'll enter data for an imaginary Soviet nuclear strike on the U.S. homeland..."
msgstr "首先，输入苏联对美国本土发动核打击的假想数据……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000009
msgid "After assessing the data as a threat,"
msgstr "在将该数据判定为威胁后，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000a
msgid ""
"Peace Walker will automatically \n"
"enter retaliation mode,"
msgstr "和平行者会自动\n进入报复模式，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000b
msgid ""
"selecting the optimal target \n"
"from a pre-defined list... "
msgstr "从预设列表中\n选出最优目标……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000c
msgid ""
"For this scenario, we have \n"
"reverse engineered the false data "
msgstr "为此，我们已对\n虚假数据做了逆向处理，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000d
msgid ""
"so that she'll inevitably end up choosing\n"
"the Caribbean Sea as her target."
msgstr "确保她最终必然选择\n加勒比海作为目标。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000e
msgid "You're really gonna do it, aren't you?"
msgstr "你真要这么做吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00000f
msgid ""
"Know this: Peace Walker's retaliation will be\n"
"the first and last of the Cold War."
msgstr "记住：和平行者的报复将是\n冷战的首次，也是最后一次。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000010
msgid ""
"It is the only way we will ever come close \n"
"to achieving true peace..."
msgstr "这是我们唯一能接近\n真正和平的途径……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000011
msgid "All that is left is to enter the code."
msgstr "剩下的就是输入密码了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000012
#: slot/0x0052801a/0x0a7cd6/0x000012
#: slot/0x00eeea4a/0x3d5434/0xdb6a29
msgid "No!"
msgstr "住手！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000013
msgid "Stand down, Big Boss."
msgstr "退下，BIG BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000014
msgid "You're late."
msgstr "你来晚了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000015
msgid "...Professor?"
msgstr "……教授？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000016
msgid "Professor..."
msgstr "教授……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000017
msgid ""
"Yes, well... Taking over the base \n"
"took longer than expected."
msgstr "是啊……接管基地\n比预想的费时。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000019
msgid ""
"I brought the technology, \n"
"you provided the money and land. "
msgstr "我出技术，\n你出资金和土地。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001a
msgid ""
"Tsentr alone could never have accomplished\n"
"so much in so little time."
msgstr "单靠中心组织绝不可能\n这么快取得如此成果。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001b
msgid "Zadornov, you backstabbing son of a...!"
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫，你这背信弃义的狗东西……！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001c
msgid ""
"\"Backstabbing?\" Correct me if I'm wrong,\n"
"but were we not enemies all along?"
msgstr "“叛徒？”我没记错的话，\n我们不一直是敌人吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001d
msgid ""
"Do you really think my comrades were working\n"
"for the Company?"
msgstr "你真以为我的同志们\n是在为那家公司卖命？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001e
msgid ""
"Do you truly think we'd faithfully serve a pack\n"
"of depraved capitalist dogs?"
msgstr "你真以为我们会忠心侍奉\n一群堕落的资本主义走狗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00001f
msgid "What are you going to do?"
msgstr "你想干什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000020
msgid "Launch a nuke... Target: Cuba."
msgstr "发射核弹……目标：古巴。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000021
msgid ""
"Have you lost your mind?!\n"
"What would you possibly gain?"
msgstr "你疯了吗？！\n你到底想得到什么？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000022
msgid "We won't be the ones launching it."
msgstr "发射的人不会是我们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000023
msgid "You, the Americans, will attack our ally, Cuba."
msgstr "你们美国人会打我们盟友古巴。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000024
msgid "WHAT?!"
msgstr "什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000025
msgid "Think, Coldman. We're on an American base, "
msgstr "想想吧，科尔德曼。我们在美国的基地里，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000026
msgid ""
"eagerly endorsed and supplied by \n"
"a pro-American regime."
msgstr "由亲美政权\n热切支持并提供。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000027
msgid "What's the international community to think?"
msgstr "国际社会会怎么想？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000028
msgid "The world will burn with anti-American sentiment! "
msgstr "全世界都会燃起反美情绪！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000029
msgid ""
"Communism will spread across \n"
"Latin America unchecked."
msgstr "共产主义将肆无忌惮地\n席卷拉丁美洲。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002a
msgid ""
"Let the age of deterrence be undone\n"
"by the deterrent itself... "
msgstr "让威慑的时代被威慑本身\n所终结……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002b
msgid "such is the Kremlin's plan."
msgstr "这就是克里姆林宫的计划。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002c
msgid "You son of a bitch..."
msgstr "你这混蛋……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002d
msgid "Paz, come here..."
msgstr "帕兹，过来……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002e
msgid "Shoot him."
msgstr "杀了他。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00002f
msgid "Professor Gálvez...?"
msgstr "加尔维斯教授……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000030
msgid "Hm... I am Vladimir Zadornov, "
msgstr "哼……我是弗拉基米尔·扎多尔诺夫，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000031
msgid ""
"and Vladimir means \"ruler of peace.\"\n"
"Now do as you're told, Paz."
msgstr "弗拉基米尔意为“和平的统治者”。\n照我说的做，帕兹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000032
msgid "Don't do it..."
msgstr "别动手…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000033
msgid ""
"Remember what they did to you \n"
"at their base on the coast..."
msgstr "想想他们在海岸基地\n对你做了什么……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000034
msgid ""
"For what Coldman's done... \n"
"he deserves nothing less than death."
msgstr "科尔德曼的所作所为……\n他死不足惜。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000035
msgid "Paz... I... I'm sorry..."
msgstr "帕兹…对不起…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000036
msgid "I can't..."
msgstr "我做不到……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000037
msgid "Truly a child of peace... "
msgstr "真是和平之子…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000038
msgid "No, wait!"
msgstr "不，等等！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000039
msgid ""
"Only fitting that retribution be delivered\n"
"by a \"dead hand.\""
msgstr "由“死手”来执行报应，\n再合适不过了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003a
msgid "You...you missed on purpose..."
msgstr "你……故意打偏……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003b
msgid ""
"Your part in this isn't done.\n"
"I need you to enter the code."
msgstr "你的任务还没完。\n我需要你输入密码。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003c
msgid ""
"Doctor, the target is now Cuba.\n"
"Please make the necessary modifications."
msgstr "博士，目标现在是古巴。\n请做必要的修改。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003d
msgid "And don't even think of resisting. "
msgstr "别想着反抗。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003e
msgid ""
"I'll crush you, but only after \n"
"I crush your \"beloved,\" first."
msgstr "我会碾碎你，但前提是\n先碾碎你的“挚爱”。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00003f
msgid "No, not that..."
msgstr "不，不是那个……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000040
msgid "Cuba is now the retaliation target."
msgstr "古巴现在是报复目标。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000041
msgid "...Very well."
msgstr "……好吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000042
msgid "Good. It is done. As for you, Big Boss..."
msgstr "很好。完成了。至于你，BIG BOSS……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000043
msgid "I've been watching you all along. "
msgstr "我一直在注视着你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000044
msgid "You've performed beyond even my highest expectations - a true comandante."
msgstr "你的表现甚至超出了我最高的期望——真正的指挥官。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000046
msgid "Why do you think I summoned you to Costa Rica, "
msgstr "你以为我为什么把你召到哥斯达黎加，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000047
msgid "had you make contact with the Sandinistas?"
msgstr "让你去接触桑地诺派？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000048
msgid ""
"A true intelligence operative \n"
"never gets his hands dirty. "
msgstr "真正的情报人员\n从不弄脏自己的手。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000049
msgid ""
"Need a revolution?\n"
"Manipulate the locals into doing it for you."
msgstr "需要革命？\n操纵当地人替你做。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004a
msgid "You mean... Amanda?! And the Sandinistas...!"
msgstr "你是说……阿曼达？！还有桑地诺派……！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004b
msgid ""
"You've done well.\n"
"You took a ragtag band of guerillas - children - "
msgstr "你干得不错。\n你把一群游击队员，孩子，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004c
msgid ""
"and shaped them into a full-fledged, \n"
"formidable army."
msgstr "打造成了一支成熟、\n令人生畏的军队。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004d
msgid ""
"And now, you'll truly become \"our century's\n"
"most complete human being\"!"
msgstr "而现在，你将真正成为“我们世纪\n最完整的人”！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004e
msgid "...Che Guevara?"
msgstr "……切·格瓦拉？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00004f
msgid ""
"None other. A hero who, gunned down \n"
"by the CIA, becomes a legendary icon."
msgstr "正是。一位被CIA枪杀，\n成为传奇图标的英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000050
msgid ""
"The Sandinistas will rise up in revenge,\n"
"overthrowing the pro-American regime "
msgstr "桑地诺派将奋起复仇，\n推翻亲美国的政权，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000051
msgid "and wresting Nicaragua from U.S. hands. "
msgstr "从美国手中夺回尼加拉瓜。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000052
msgid ""
"And the nuclear strike on Cuba, naturally,\n"
"will be the last straw."
msgstr "而对古巴的核打击，自然，\n将是最后一根稻草。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000053
msgid "Mammal Pod data entry is complete."
msgstr "哺乳舱数据输入完成。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000054
msgid "Dead at age 39... Just like El Che."
msgstr "39岁就死了……跟切一样。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000055
msgid "...Ironic, isn't it?"
msgstr "……真讽刺。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000056
msgid "In the end, a legend is merely fiction. "
msgstr "到头来，传奇不过是虚构。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000057
msgid ""
"You'll die as The Boss did and become, \n"
"as did she, an eternal fraud."
msgstr "你会像THE BOSS那样死去，\n和她一样，成永恒骗局。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000058
msgid "¡Venceremos!"
msgstr "¡Venceremos!"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000059
#: slot/0x0048f045/0x0a7cd6/0x00001c
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4686bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0x4e8ebf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xb262bf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xba6abf/0x000000
#: slot/0x0083c375/0xc2c774/0x000000
#: slot/0x00ce245c/0x0a7cd6/0x000008
#: slot/0x00ce245c/0x0a7cd6/0x00002a
msgid "Freeze!"
msgstr "不许动！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005a
msgid "You dare point your gun at a comrade?!"
msgstr "你敢拿枪指着同志？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005b
msgid ""
"We will not be pawns of the KGB.\n"
"We will win our own victory!"
msgstr "我们不做克格勃棋子。\n要赢自己的胜利！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005c
msgid "¡Hasta la victoria siempre!"
msgstr "¡Hasta la victoria siempre!"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005e
msgid "We're home! Look, we're back in Nica!"
msgstr "回家了！看，回到尼加了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00005f
msgid "We did it, Amand- I mean, comandante!"
msgstr "做到了，阿曼达，指挥官！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000060
msgid "Boss, you hurt...?"
msgstr "BOSS，你受伤了……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000061
msgid "I'm fine."
msgstr "我没事。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000062
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000064
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000065
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000066
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000067
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000068
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000069
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x00007d
msgid "Vic Boss!"
msgstr "VIC BOSS!"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000063
msgid "Vic Boss..."
msgstr "Vic Boss……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006a
msgid "You're a regular Joan of Arc."
msgstr "你简直是圣女贞德。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006b
msgid "Nonsense, you're the hero here."
msgstr "胡说，你才是英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006c
msgid "You saved my life. You're the heroes, here."
msgstr "你救了我的命。你们才是英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006d
msgid "Heh. I never figured you for a softie, Snake."
msgstr "呵。没想到你也心软，SNAKE。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006e
msgid "Thanks. It's good to see you."
msgstr "谢谢。见到你真好。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00006f
msgid "Paz can stay with us until she's back on her feet."
msgstr "帕兹可以留下养伤，直到康复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000070
msgid "And the \"professor\"?"
msgstr "那“教授”呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000071
msgid "We'll find him a nice, comfy cell."
msgstr "给他找个舒服牢房。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000072
msgid ""
"Coldman's lost a lot of blood. \n"
"He may not make it..."
msgstr "科尔德曼失血过多。\n他可能撑不住……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000073
msgid "Where's Amanda?"
msgstr "阿曼达呢？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000074
msgid "Back with her compas. She'll catch up later."
msgstr "带罗盘回来了。她随后赶上。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000075
msgid "How about you, Snake...?"
msgstr "你呢，SNAKE……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000076
msgid "I'm not done yet."
msgstr "我还没完。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000077
msgid "The AI?"
msgstr "AI？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000078
msgid "I have to finish this."
msgstr "我得做个了结。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000079
msgid "That Boss is a fake. I'm gonna bury it."
msgstr "那BOSS是假的。我要埋了它。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007a
msgid "We'll save the champagne until you get back."
msgstr "香槟留到你回来再开。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007b
msgid "May as well celebrate peace... while it lasts."
msgstr "不如趁和平还在……庆祝一下。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007c
msgid ""
"I didn't bring her back to life \n"
"because I was forced to."
msgstr "我让她复活\n不是因为我被迫这么做。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007d
msgid ""
"I wanted to know how she really felt...\n"
"how it really ended."
msgstr "我想知道她真正的感受……\n真正的结局。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007e
msgid "The Boss is dead."
msgstr "BOSS死了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00007f
msgid "No, she's alive."
msgstr "不，她还活着。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000080
msgid "Some truths are better left buried."
msgstr "有些真相还是埋着好。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000081
msgid ""
"You don't mean that. Be honest.\n"
"You want to know, too, don't you?"
msgstr "你不是真心的。老实说吧。\n你也想知道，对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000082
msgid ""
"Whether what you saw and heard \n"
"at the end was the truth?"
msgstr "你在最后看到和听到的\n究竟是不是真相？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000083
msgid "She'll tell us. I know she will."
msgstr "她会说的。我知道。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000084
msgid "Thank you for stopping them."
msgstr "谢谢你阻止了他们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000085
msgid "And... I'm sorry."
msgstr "还有……对不起。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000086
msgid "I can't imagine how it hurt."
msgstr "我无法想象多痛。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000087
msgid "...I'll live."
msgstr "……我死不了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000088
msgid "I'm used to shock therapy. "
msgstr "我习惯电击疗法了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000089
msgid "You are? Well... that's very kind of you to say."
msgstr "是吗？嗯……你这么说真是太好了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008a
msgid "Let's go meet her, shall we? Get in..."
msgstr "去见她吧，好吗？上车……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008b
msgid "...Boss."
msgstr "……BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008c
msgid ""
"Don't pick up a gun \n"
"unless you know how to use it."
msgstr "不懂怎么用枪\n就别捡枪。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008d
msgid ""
"Aiming a weapon alone \n"
"doesn't make it a deterrent."
msgstr "光靠瞄准武器\n并不能构成威慑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008e
msgid "You're the angel of peace. Leave the guns to us."
msgstr "你是和平天使。枪交给我们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00008f
msgid "That was our agreement, remember?"
msgstr "这是约定，记得吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000090
msgid ""
"The army's leaving Costa Rica now.\n"
"The mission is complete."
msgstr "军队现在撤离哥斯达黎加。\n任务完成。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000091
msgid "Paz?"
msgstr "帕兹？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000092
msgid "...Thank you."
msgstr "……谢谢你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000093
msgid "...What's that noise?"
msgstr "……那是什么声音？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000094
msgid "What'd he do...?!"
msgstr "他干了什么……？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000095
msgid "I should have killed you when I had the chance!"
msgstr "我当初就该杀了你！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000096
msgid "...NORAD's nightmare is about to begin."
msgstr "……北美防空司令部的噩梦要开始了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000098
msgid ""
"Peace Walker... determines retaliation targets...\n"
"based on enemy nuclear strike data..."
msgstr "和平行者……根据敌方核打击数据……\n确定报复目标……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x000099
msgid ""
"That data... can be sent... \n"
"to third parties, as well..."
msgstr "那些数据……也能……\n发送给第三方……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009a
msgid ""
"We got big problems, Snake.\n"
"Coldman's activated the nuclear launch switch!"
msgstr "出大事了，SNAKE。\n科尔德曼启动了核发射开关！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009b
msgid "What?! And the target's Cuba?"
msgstr "什么？！目标是古巴？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009c
msgid ""
"Yeah. But that's not it.\n"
"The son of a bitch has screwed us all over."
msgstr "对。但不止如此。\n那混蛋把我们全坑了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009d
msgid "When Peace Walker was activated,"
msgstr "和平行者启动后，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009e
msgid "it started transmitting the false data set"
msgstr "就开始把伪造数据"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x00009f
msgid "to NORAD."
msgstr "发送给北美防空司令部。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a0
msgid ""
"It's using a spread spectrum MLF\n"
" (multilength frequency) signal... "
msgstr "它用的是扩频MLF\n（多频）信号……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a1
msgid ""
"It can't be blacked out even by EMP\n"
"(electromagnetic pulse)."
msgstr "连EMP\n（电磁脉冲）都无法屏蔽。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a2
msgid "There's no way to tell the difference "
msgstr "根本无法分辨"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a3
msgid ""
"between false data and \n"
"the real thing on a radar screen."
msgstr "雷达屏幕上的伪造数据\n和真实数据。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a4
msgid ""
"NORAD will have no idea it's all a ruse \n"
"generated by Peace Walker."
msgstr "北美防空不知道\n这全是和平行者的假象。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a5
msgid "They'll think it's a real Soviet attack."
msgstr "他们会以为是苏联真打来了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a6
msgid ""
"They'll pass on the data to the National Military\n"
"Command Center... "
msgstr "他们会把数据传给国家军事\n指挥中心……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a7
msgid ""
"And Washington will have to choose \n"
"whether or not to retaliate."
msgstr "华盛顿将不得不决定\n是否进行报复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000a8
msgid ""
"This could get ugly! Unless we stop it,\n"
"we're looking at a retaliatory chain-reaction! "
msgstr "这会变得很糟！除非我们阻止它，\n否则将引发报复连锁反应！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000aa
msgid ""
"No need to panic. \n"
"The nightmare will end soon enough."
msgstr "不必恐慌。\n噩梦很快就会结束。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ac
msgid "Coldman's aim "
msgstr "科尔德曼的目的"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ad
msgid ""
"is for the bureaucrats in Washington to see\n"
"the importance of a machine"
msgstr "是让华盛顿的官僚们看到\n一种机器的重要性"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ae
msgid "like Peace Walker."
msgstr "比如和平行者。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000af
msgid ""
"...He's trying to prove that humans \n"
"don't possess the will to launch nukes."
msgstr "……他想证明人类\n没有发射核弹的意志。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b0
msgid ""
"Everything will be fine. They'll never retaliate.\n"
"They're only human..."
msgstr "一切都会没事。他们不会报复。\n他们只是人类……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b1
msgid "Kaz, where's the President?"
msgstr "卡兹，总统在哪？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b2
msgid ""
"...Last I heard he was in the middle of SALT II\n"
"negotiations in Vladivostok."
msgstr "……我最后听说他在海参崴\n参加第二阶段限武谈判。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b3
msgid "With the president gone, "
msgstr "总统不在，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b4
msgid "nuclear launch authority passes to the next person in the chain of succession."
msgstr "核发射权就移交给继任顺序中的下一个人。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b5
msgid ""
"The Vice President's gone, too,\n"
"so after him comes the Speaker..."
msgstr "副总统也不在，\n所以接下来是众议院议长……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b6
msgid "...President, Vice President... "
msgstr "……总统、副总统……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b7
msgid ""
"Not one among them has \n"
"the courage to push the button. "
msgstr "他们中没有一个人\n有勇气按下按钮。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b8
msgid ""
"No one willing to enter history \n"
"as the Great Destroyer."
msgstr "没人愿意以伟大毁灭者的身份\n载入史册。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000b9
msgid ""
"In the end, it's not their lives that \n"
"people value most... it's their reputations!"
msgstr "说到底，人们最看重的不是自己的命……\n而是自己的名声！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ba
msgid ""
"The bureaucrats in Washington \n"
"may not be able to retaliate. "
msgstr "华盛顿的官僚们\n也许无法进行报复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bb
msgid "Peace Walker, on the other hand..."
msgstr "但和平行者就不同了……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bc
msgid "She's loyal to the mission above all. "
msgstr "她忠于任务高于一切。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bd
msgid ""
"And she's well aware that \n"
"guaranteed retaliation is essential"
msgstr "而且她很清楚，\n确保报复能力至关重要，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000be
msgid "for nuclear deterrence to work."
msgstr "核威慑才能奏效。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000bf
msgid "Peace Walker is the perfect deterrent."
msgstr "和平行者是完美的威慑。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c0
msgid "Cuba would not have been my choice of targets... "
msgstr "古巴不会是我的目标选择……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c1
msgid ""
"but you can't make peace \n"
"without breaking a few eggs."
msgstr "但想实现和平\n总得打破几个鸡蛋。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c2
msgid ""
"Now that Peace Walker has the false data...\n"
"retaliation is inevitable."
msgstr "如今和平行者已掌握假数据...\n报复已不可避免。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c3
msgid "Are you insane? "
msgstr "你疯了吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c4
msgid ""
"You think it'll end there?!\n"
"You're about to unleash all-out nuclear war!"
msgstr "你以为这样就完了？！\n你这是要引发全面核战争！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c5
msgid "Somebody find out what's going on at NORAD!"
msgstr "快查北美防空司令部怎么回事！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c6
msgid ""
"Mammal's got a connection to NORAD.\n"
"We could monitor it with the right equipment."
msgstr "Mammal和北美防空司令部有连接。\n有合适的设备就能监听。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c7
msgid "I've got you covered."
msgstr "交给我吧。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c8
msgid "I've got NORAD on the line."
msgstr "北美防空司令部接通了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000c9
msgid "Sir, we're tracking unidentified targets."
msgstr "长官，我们追踪到不明目标。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ca
msgid "Current apogee 20 degrees. Estimated time of reentry is two-two-five-zero Zulu."
msgstr "当前远地点20度。预计再入时间22点50分祖鲁时间。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cb
msgid "Have you contacted the President?"
msgstr "联系上总统了吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cc
msgid "Coverall is not responding."
msgstr "Coverall没有回应。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cd
msgid ""
"Warning system checks out.\n"
"No corresponding natural signatures. "
msgstr "预警系统检查无误。\n无对应自然信号。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000ce
msgid "Data is assessed as reliable."
msgstr "数据评估为可靠。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000cf
msgid ""
"Cut the data transmission! We can't say for sure\n"
"Washington isn't going to retaliate!"
msgstr "切断数据传输！我们无法确定\n华盛顿不会反击！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d0
msgid ""
"The only one who knows... \n"
"the abort code... is me..."
msgstr "唯一知道...\n中止密码的...只有我..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d1
msgid "I die... and no one can turn it off..."
msgstr "我一死...就没人能关了..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d2
msgid ""
"Even if they do strike back... \n"
"I'll already... be dead..."
msgstr "就算他们真的反击...\n我早就...死了..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d3
msgid ""
"I can only pray... that my theory... \n"
"my peace... is proven right..."
msgstr "我只能祈祷...我的理论...\n我的和平...是正确的..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d4
msgid "Pea..."
msgstr "和..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d5
msgid "...ce"
msgstr "...平"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d6
msgid "...Go to DEFCON 3."
msgstr "...进入三级战备状态。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d7
msgid "Get SAC on the phone."
msgstr "接通战略空军司令部。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d8
msgid ""
"This is Crystal Palace.\n"
"Standby for an emergency meeting."
msgstr "这里是水晶宫。\n准备召开紧急会议。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000d9
msgid "...They're at DEFCON 3."
msgstr "...他们进入三级战备了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000da
msgid ""
"The false data and the nukes are \n"
"both coming from the same source... "
msgstr "假数据和核弹\n来自同一个源头..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000db
msgid "we have to stop Peace Walker!"
msgstr "必须阻止和平行者！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000dc
msgid "The only way is to destroy her."
msgstr "只能摧毁她。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000dd
msgid "She's entered launch mode. Peace Walker's rendered her judgment. The target is Cuba!"
msgstr "她已进入发射模式。和平行者已做出判断。目标是古巴！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b054d/0x33d29e/0x0000de
msgid "Snake, don't let it launch the nuke!"
msgstr "SNAKE，别让它发射核弹！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000000
msgid ""
"It stopped moving... Snake, you did it.\n"
"You stopped the launch!"
msgstr "它停止移动了……SNAKE，你做到了。\n你阻止了发射！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000001
msgid "Huey, how's NORAD?!"
msgstr "休伊，北美防空司令部那边怎么样？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000002
msgid "Not good... "
msgstr "不太好……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000003
msgid "BMEWS continues to track the targets on radar."
msgstr "BMEWS仍在雷达追踪目标。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000004
msgid ""
"DSP satellite status is green.\n"
"Still assessing as reliable."
msgstr "国防支援卫星状态正常。\n仍判定为可靠。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000005
msgid ""
"Chairman of the Joint Chiefs, \n"
"a representative of the Secretary of Defense, "
msgstr "参谋长联席会议主席、\n国防部长代表，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000006
msgid "and Congress have arrived at NMCC."
msgstr "国会已抵达NMCC。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000007
msgid ""
"You've only damaged the drive system...\n"
"The data uplink's still intact..."
msgstr "你只破坏了驱动系统……\n数据上行链路仍然完好……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000008
msgid ""
"We've got 1,500 Soviet ICBMs \n"
"crossing the North Pole. "
msgstr "1500枚苏联洲际导弹\n正穿越北极。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000009
msgid ""
"Target region is confirmed as the west coast\n"
"of the United States."
msgstr "目标区域确认为美国西海岸\n。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000a
msgid "Go to DEFCON 2. Prepare to launch ICBMs."
msgstr "进入二级戒备。准备发射洲际弹道导弹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000b
msgid "How do I make it stop?!"
msgstr "怎么让它停？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000c
msgid "Peace Walker is a fully autonomous system."
msgstr "和平行者是完全自主的系统。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000d
msgid "Unlike the other machines you've fought, "
msgstr "与你打过的其他机器不同，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000e
msgid ""
"its command authorities are all located inside\n"
"its cerebrum, the Mammal Pod."
msgstr "它的指挥权限全部位于\n其大脑——哺乳舱内部。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00000f
msgid "We've got to stop the Mammal Pod...!"
msgstr "我们必须阻止哺乳舱……！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000010
msgid ""
"I don't have the abort code either.\n"
"Coldman was the only one..."
msgstr "我也没有中止代码。\n只有科尔德曼有……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000011
msgid "Snake, destroy the AI inside the Mammal Pod!"
msgstr "SNAKE，摧毁哺乳舱里的AI！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000012
msgid "The inner barrier protecting the Mammal Pod "
msgstr "保护哺乳舱的内层屏障"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000013
msgid "is designed to be as strong as a bomb shelter."
msgstr "被设计得如同防空洞一般坚固。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000014
msgid "What's it gonna take to get through?"
msgstr "要怎样才能打穿它？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000015
msgid "I... I guess an atomic bomb would do it..."
msgstr "我……我想原子弹应该可以……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000016
msgid "You trying to be funny?"
msgstr "你在开玩笑吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000017
msgid ""
"No! I'm telling you, that armor was designed\n"
"to withstand a nuclear war!"
msgstr "不！我告诉你，那装甲是设计来\n抵御核战争的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000018
msgid ""
"We can't get through to the President.\n"
"The decision is on us."
msgstr "联系不上总统。\n只能我们自己决定了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000019
msgid "You can't be serious!"
msgstr "你认真的？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001a
msgid ""
"There's no way I'm gonna \n"
"wipe out the human race."
msgstr "我绝不可能\n毁灭人类。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001b
msgid "This is the President's call!"
msgstr "这该由总统决定！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001c
msgid ""
"There's no time for that. \n"
"We need a decision, now."
msgstr "没时间了。\n必须马上决定。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001d
msgid ""
"Huey, get the Pentagon on the line!\n"
"We have to tell them the nukes aren't real!"
msgstr "休伊，接通五角大楼！\n得告诉他们核弹是假的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001e
msgid "I'll give it a shot."
msgstr "我试试。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00001f
msgid "Forget the order of succession. "
msgstr "别管继任顺序了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000020
msgid ""
"If we're all going to hell, \n"
"let's take those bastards with us!"
msgstr "既然都要下地狱，\n就拉那些混蛋一起陪葬！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000021
msgid "We have twelve minutes to impact, sir."
msgstr "距撞击十二分钟，长官。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000022
msgid "...May God have mercy on our souls."
msgstr "……愿上帝怜悯我们。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000023
msgid "Jesus... Coldman guessed wrong!"
msgstr "天哪……科尔德曼猜错了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000024
msgid "They're gonna go through with it!"
msgstr "他们真要动手了！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000025
msgid "The platform's sustained a lot of external damage. All we need is some pressure... "
msgstr "平台外部损伤严重。只差一点压力……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000026
msgid "Pressure?"
msgstr "压力？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000027
msgid ""
"Sink it in the lake. \n"
"With that much water pressure, "
msgstr "把它沉进湖里。\n那么大的水压，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000028
msgid ""
"even the tiniest crack should be \n"
"enough to flood the innards."
msgstr "哪怕最细小的裂缝\n也足以让内部进水。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000029
msgid ""
"The AI pod is a mass of \n"
"highly sensitive electronics. "
msgstr "AI 舱体是大量\n高精密电子元件。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002a
msgid "Short the contacts and the signal will stop."
msgstr "让触点短路，信号就会停止。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002b
msgid "How much does that thing weigh?"
msgstr "那东西有多重？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002c
msgid "500 tons."
msgstr "500 吨。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002d
msgid "It's hopeless. We can't move that thing."
msgstr "没戏了。搬不动那东西。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002e
msgid "Get the Pentagon on the phone!"
msgstr "接五角大楼！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00002f
msgid "Incoming MIRV warheads have separated."
msgstr "来袭分导弹头已分离。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000030
msgid "Estimated time to impact now eleven minutes."
msgstr "预计撞击时间还有十一分钟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000031
msgid "Sir, we've got a call!"
msgstr "长官，有电话！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000032
msgid "The President?!"
msgstr "总统？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000033
msgid "No, sir."
msgstr "不，长官。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000034
msgid "Then who?"
msgstr "那是谁？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000035
msgid "He, um..."
msgstr "他，呃……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000036
msgid "Spit it out!"
msgstr "快说！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000037
msgid "He claims to be... Big Boss."
msgstr "他自称是…BIG BOSS。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000038
msgid "Big Boss? Patch him through!"
msgstr "BIG BOSS？接进来！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000039
msgid "Mr. Chairman, I'll get straight to the point."
msgstr "主席先生，我就直说了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003a
msgid "Cancel the retaliatory strike, now!"
msgstr "取消报复性打击，立刻！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003c
msgid ""
"The radar blips you're seeing are all fakes.\n"
"No one's launched any nukes."
msgstr "你看到的雷达光点全是假的。\n没人发射任何核弹。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003d
msgid "How do you know?"
msgstr "你咋知道？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003e
msgid ""
"The launch data is fake, \n"
"part of an experiment that leaked. "
msgstr "发射数据是假的，\n是一次实验泄露出来的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00003f
msgid ""
"You weren't supposed to receive it.\n"
"Your radar is showing missiles that don't exist."
msgstr "本不该传到你们那里。\n你们雷达上的导弹根本不存在。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000040
msgid ""
"If you're lying, then we've got \n"
"10 minutes 'til we're toast. "
msgstr "你要是撒谎，我们\n十分钟后就完蛋了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000041
msgid "We have to retaliate or more Americans die."
msgstr "我们必须报复，否则会有更多美国人丧命。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000042
msgid "The experiment was planned and executed "
msgstr "那次实验的策划与执行者"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000043
msgid "by the CIA's station chief in Central America."
msgstr "是CIA驻中美洲情报站站长。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000044
msgid "Then put him on!"
msgstr "那就让他接电话！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000045
msgid "He's dead. I can give you his name, though."
msgstr "他死了。名字可以给你。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000046
msgid ""
"We need more than the authentication code\n"
"you gave the switchboard."
msgstr "我们需要的不只是你给总机的那串验证码\n。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000047
msgid ""
" We need proof you're actually Big Boss.\n"
"Do you have any?"
msgstr "我们需要证据证明你真是BIG BOSS。\n你有吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000048
msgid "Alright... If you know the name Big Boss..."
msgstr "好吧……如果你知道BIG BOSS……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000049
msgid "Then maybe you were there... at the ceremony... "
msgstr "那你也许当时在场……在典礼上……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004a
msgid "when I received the title from President Johnson."
msgstr "我从约翰逊总统接过称号时。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004b
msgid "Indeed I was..."
msgstr "我确实在场……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004c
msgid "We don't have time for this bullshit!"
msgstr "我们没时间听这些废话！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004d
msgid "Hold it! Let's hear him out. You were saying?"
msgstr "等等！让他说完。你刚才说？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004e
msgid ""
"At the ceremony, the DCI tried to shake my hand.\n"
"I refused."
msgstr "典礼上，DCI想跟我握手。\n我拒绝了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00004f
msgid ""
"What happened in that room is \n"
"classified - top secret."
msgstr "那间屋子里发生的事是\n最高机密。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000050
msgid "Only a handful of people would know."
msgstr "只有少数几个人会知道。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000051
msgid "He's making it up! Don't listen to him!"
msgstr "他在编故事！别听他的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000052
msgid "Wait! Why did you refuse to shake his hand?"
msgstr "等等！你为什么拒绝跟他握手？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000053
msgid "Because I knew where my loyalty belonged."
msgstr "因为我知道我的忠诚属于谁。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000054
msgid ""
"Everybody, listen to me!\n"
"Those Soviet missiles are fakes!"
msgstr "各位，听我说！\n那些苏联导弹是假的！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000055
msgid "What?! You're actually going to believe him?"
msgstr "什么？！你真要信他？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000056
msgid "He's right! This is some sort of Commie trick!"
msgstr "他说得对！这是共产党的诡计！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000057
msgid "No, it's the real Big Boss. Trust me."
msgstr "不，他是真正的BIG BOSS。相信我。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000058
msgid "How can you know for sure?!"
msgstr "你怎么能确定？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000059
msgid "Because I was the Army Chief of Staff back then, "
msgstr "因为当时我是陆军参谋长，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005a
msgid ""
"and I was standing right next to the DCI\n"
"when it happened. I saw everything."
msgstr "事发时我就站在DCI旁边。\n我全看见了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005b
msgid ""
"You saved us all, Big Boss.\n"
"We'll stand down the alert."
msgstr "你救了我们，BIG BOSS。\n我们解除警报。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005d
msgid "When we meet again, I hope you'll shake my hand. "
msgstr "下次见面时，希望你能跟我握手。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005e
msgid "What are you doing?!"
msgstr "你干嘛？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x00005f
msgid "Sorry, Chairman. But we are not standing down!"
msgstr "抱歉，主席。但我们不解除警报！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000060
msgid "Dammit...!"
msgstr "该死！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000061
msgid "Those worthless sacks of..."
msgstr "那些没用的废物……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000062
msgid "Wait..."
msgstr "等等……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000065
msgid "It's opening...?"
msgstr "它开了…？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000066
msgid "She's calling to you..."
msgstr "她在呼唤你……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000067
msgid ""
"Destroy the Mammal Pod \n"
"and the data will stop flowing!"
msgstr "摧毁哺乳舱\n数据就会停止传输！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b058d/0x39a076/0x000068
msgid "Please, stop her..."
msgstr "求你，拦她…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000000
msgid "Valid data regions: Zero."
msgstr "有效数据区域：ZERO。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000001
msgid "Exit all done."
msgstr "退出完成。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000002
msgid "...It stopped."
msgstr "…停了。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000003
msgid "The data uplink's bypassing the Mammal Pod...?"
msgstr "数据上行绕过了哺乳舱……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000004
msgid "Put down the gun!"
msgstr "把枪放下！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000005
msgid "Come to your senses, man! "
msgstr "清醒点，老兄！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x53ff27/0x000006
msgid ""
"The fate of the world... \n"
"the fate of Earth is at stake here!"
msgstr "世界的命运……\n地球的命运在此一举！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000000
msgid "Why?!"
msgstr "为什么？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000001
msgid "I don't understand!!"
msgstr "我不明白！！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000002
msgid "Answer me!!"
msgstr "回答我！！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000003
msgid "Tell me why!!"
msgstr "说啊！！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000004
msgid "ANSWER ME!!!"
msgstr "回答我！！！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0x82ca49/0x000005
msgid "BO-O-O-OSS!!!!"
msgstr "头——儿——！！！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000000
msgid "Six minutes remaining."
msgstr "剩余六分钟。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000001
msgid ""
"...Wait. Authority rests with me now.\n"
"I'm ordering a retaliation."
msgstr "……等等。现在指挥权在我手上。\n我下令反击。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000002
msgid "No, don't! It's the end of us all!"
msgstr "不，别！会害死大家！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000003
msgid ""
"Who gives a damn?!\n"
"I'm not gonna sit here and die like a dog!"
msgstr "谁管？！\n我才不坐这等死！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000004
msgid "If the Russians are gonna kill my family "
msgstr "如果俄国人要杀我家人"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000005
msgid "and destroy my country, I'm taking them with me!"
msgstr "毁我国家，我就拉他们一起陪葬！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000006
msgid ""
"You see now, Chairman?\n"
"Deterrence is just a fool's dream."
msgstr "看到了吧，议长？\n威慑是蠢人梦。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000007
msgid "Why?! Why won't it stop?!"
msgstr "为什么？！为什么停不下来？！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000008
msgid ""
"Sometimes the body continues to live\n"
"even after the brain is damaged."
msgstr "有时大脑受损后\n身体仍会继续存活。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x000009
msgid "The Boss AI isn't doing this. "
msgstr "这不是THE BOSS AI干的。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000a
msgid "I think it's something rather more primitive..."
msgstr "我觉得是更原始的东西……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000b
msgid "Reptile has taken up Mammal's dying wish... "
msgstr "爬虫类继承了哺乳类的遗愿……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000c
msgid "No... "
msgstr "不……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ad/0xa2a033/0x00000e
msgid "Don't just sit there! STOP IT!"
msgstr "别光坐着！快阻止它！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000001
msgid "That voice..."
msgstr "那声音…"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000002
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00002e
#: slot/0x00dff0a5/0xa84a6a/0x000073
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "什么……？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000003
msgid "...What's going on?"
msgstr "…怎么回事？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000004
msgid "That song..."
msgstr "那首歌……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000005
msgid "Boss... is that you...?"
msgstr "BOSS…是你吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000006
msgid "How in the...?"
msgstr "怎么会？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000007
msgid "A ghost in the machine...?"
msgstr "机器里的幽灵？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000008
msgid "She's drowning herself to stop the transmission?"
msgstr "她是在自我淹没以停止传输？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000009
msgid "Look!"
msgstr "看！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000a
msgid "It's functional compensation. "
msgstr "这是功能代偿。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000b
msgid ""
"When the human brain is damaged,\n"
"sometimes it recovers over time."
msgstr "人脑受损后，\n有时会随着时间恢复。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000c
msgid ""
"Other parts of the brain take over the functions\n"
"of the damaged parts."
msgstr "大脑其他部分会接管\n受损部分的功能。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000d
msgid ""
"Mammal and Reptile were patterned after\n"
"different parts of the human brain."
msgstr "哺乳类和爬虫类分别仿照\n人脑的不同部分。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000e
msgid ""
"When those parts were assembled \n"
"together into one, "
msgstr "当这些部分被组装\n到一起时，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00000f
msgid ""
"they must've become capable \n"
"of functional compensation..."
msgstr "它们一定变得能够\n进行功能代偿……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000010
msgid "Her memories remained with her..."
msgstr "她的记忆留了下来……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000011
msgid "Is this her answer?"
msgstr "这是她答案？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000012
msgid "This song?"
msgstr "这歌？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000013
msgid ""
"It's clearly not thinking rationally...\n"
"It's not using its head... "
msgstr "它显然不是在理性思考……\n它没有用脑子……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000014
msgid "It's using... its heart."
msgstr "它在用……心。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000015
msgid "This is the fate she chose for herself."
msgstr "这是她为自己选择的命运。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000016
msgid "The Boss' innocence has been proven..."
msgstr "THE BOSS的清白得到了证明……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000017
msgid ""
"Do you hear it, Snake? \n"
"Do you hear The Boss' song?"
msgstr "你听到了吗，SNAKE？\n你听到THE BOSS的歌了吗？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000018
msgid "You saw it, didn't you?"
msgstr "你看到了，对吧？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000019
msgid "When you went to space..."
msgstr "你去太空时……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001a
msgid "That there's beauty outside of battle."
msgstr "战斗之外也有美。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001b
msgid "At last I understand. In the end..."
msgstr "我终于明白了。到头来……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001c
msgid "It was you who put down your gun..."
msgstr "是你放下了枪……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001d
msgid "And chose instead to sing..."
msgstr "转而选择了歌唱……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001e
msgid "They can all hear you... I know they can..."
msgstr "他们都听得到……我知道……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x00001f
msgid "And your will shall surely live on."
msgstr "你的意志必将延续。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000020
msgid ""
"That's what you wanted... so much that \n"
"you gave up everything you had..."
msgstr "那是你想要的……你甚至为此\n舍弃了你拥有的一切……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000021
msgid "But you couldn't achieve it."
msgstr "但你没能实现它。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000022
msgid "Isn't that right? And still all you can do is sing."
msgstr "不是吗？而你所能做的依然只是歌唱。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000023
msgid "There's no peace to be found, anywhere."
msgstr "哪里都找不到和平。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000024
msgid "And so we can only keep on hoping..."
msgstr "所以我们只能继续期盼……"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05b2/0x39a064/0x000025
msgid "Hoping for the illusion we call peace."
msgstr "期盼那名为和平的幻象。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000000
msgid ""
"Once upon a time, there were two young men\n"
"who idolized a hero called The Boss. "
msgstr "从前，有两个年轻人\n崇拜着一位名叫THE BOSS的英雄。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000001
msgid ""
"One day, they suddenly lost \n"
"the point of origin - the cipher -"
msgstr "有一天，他们突然失去了\n原点，那密码，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000002
msgid ""
"that was like a mother to them.\n"
"Unable to come to terms with their sorrow,"
msgstr "对他们而言如同母亲一般。\n无法接受这份悲伤，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000003
msgid ""
"they each decided to carry \n"
"on the will of their hero."
msgstr "他们各自决定\n继承英雄的意志。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000004
msgid "But they could not agree on what that meant."
msgstr "但他们对含义无法达成一致。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000005
msgid ""
"In the end, they became bitter enemies,\n"
"and the zero from which they both started"
msgstr "最终，他们成了死敌，\n而他们共同出发的那个零"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000006
msgid "was split into two."
msgstr "被一分为二。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000007
msgid ""
"...And you have been on the wrong \n"
"path ever since."
msgstr "...而你从此走上了错误的\n道路。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000008
msgid ""
"There's no \"happily ever after\" \n"
"waiting for you in the end. Unless... "
msgstr "最终等待你的，不会是\n\"幸福结局\"。除非..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000009
msgid "You obey the will of Cipher!"
msgstr "你服从Cipher的意志！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000a
msgid "Where does an army without borders call home? "
msgstr "一支没有国界的军队，家在何方？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000b
msgid ""
"A state without borders, of course...\n"
"a world without borders. "
msgstr "无国界的国家，当然...\n无国界的世界。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000c
msgid "A world without borders..?"
msgstr "无国界的世界..？"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000d
msgid "The Cold War order is about to collapse. "
msgstr "冷战秩序即将崩溃。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000e
msgid ""
"The age of electronic intelligence is \n"
"about to begin. "
msgstr "电子情报的时代\n即将开始。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00000f
msgid "The NSA (National Security Agency),"
msgstr "NSA（国家安全局），"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000010
msgid "CSS (Central Security Service),"
msgstr "CSS（中央安全局），"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000011
msgid "NRO (National Reconnaissance Office),"
msgstr "NRO（国家侦察局），"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000012
msgid ""
"DIA (Defense Intelligence Agency), \n"
"et cetera, et cetera..."
msgstr "DIA（国防情报局），\n等等，等等..."

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000013
msgid ""
"The intelligence community \n"
"that has long bickered amongst itself "
msgstr "长期以来内斗不休的\n情报界"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000014
msgid "will be united in a world governed by electrons."
msgstr "将在电子主宰的世界中团结一致。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000015
msgid "Cipher will gather all information,"
msgstr "Cipher将收集所有情报，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000016
msgid ""
"watching over the world \n"
"and guiding the will of its people,"
msgstr "监视世界\n并引导民众的意志，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000017
msgid "all while they remain blissfully unaware."
msgstr "而他们始终浑然不觉。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000018
msgid "There will be no one to oppose them! "
msgstr "将无人能与之抗衡！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x000019
msgid ""
"For the first time, \n"
"the world will be ruled by a single will!"
msgstr "世界将首次\n被单一意志所统治！"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001a
msgid "Until the new order is in place,"
msgstr "在新秩序建立之前，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001b
msgid ""
"you and your army will be \n"
"the force that protects it."
msgstr "你和你的军队将是\n守护它的力量。"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001c
msgid "You will be Cipher's deterrent,"
msgstr "你将成为Cipher的威慑，"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001d
msgid "pulling the wool over the eyes of the old order"
msgstr "以你的魅力和军事才能"

#. comic cutscene
#: slot/0x003b05ed/0x52eb7f/0x00001e
msgid "with your charisma and military prowess."
msgstr "蒙蔽旧秩序的双眼。"
